        "detailed_description": "<h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/1649fbb5517b5247f9c08ff3156f9644.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/1649fbb5517b5247f9c08ff3156f9644.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special edition that comes as a set including the main game, Bubble Bobble Sugar Dungeons, and the Deluxe Content, which contains the digital soundtrack and digital art book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The Deluxe Content is not planned to be sold separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Bubble Bobble Sugar Dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with every adventure! The first Bubble Bobble with progression!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sweet dungeons and castles that change each time you enter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mastery of bubbles to defeat enemies, explore, and gather treasure to learn new skills and journey even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Bubble Symphony is included</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Deluxe Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Digital Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to 25 music tracks from Bubble Bobble Sugar Dungeons within this digital content. Enjoy the music newly composed for this title by the ZUNTATA team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Digital Art Book</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >113-page art book features initial costume designs for Bub, reference materials and design drafts for new characters, enemies, and items, as well as concept art. It's an art book that offers a glimpse into the charming world of Bubble Bobble Sugar Dungeons.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Update Details】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ●Boost the fun with the Bonus Gates guided by Bob!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bub's twin brother, Bob, makes an appearance to support Bub's adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bob's Room within the Dungeon, you can choose your destination from 3 exciting Bonus Gates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 3 choices are the Item Room where you can obtain lots of treasure chests and items, the Combo Room where you can defeat enemies all at once to rack up combos, and the Skip Gate where you can skip multiple floors at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your adventure while choosing the perfect bonus for you at that moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ● Major boost to dropped items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The variety and drop rates of items, including invincibility items, have been greatly increased!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other powerful items that will help you on your adventure have also been added!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click here for other detailed balance adjustments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Quests, More Power! An All New Bubble Bobble Experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sweet dungeons and castles that change each time you enter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mastery of bubbles to defeat enemies, explore, and gather treasure to learn new skills and journey even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bub the bubble-blowing dragon's big adventure through shifting sweet dungeons and castles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow bubbles to trap enemies, then use your horn or back spikes to pop and defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubbles are moved by the wind. Jump on top of them to access even higher places!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/af044c4723ff21634e66eba3c065c26d.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/af044c4723ff21634e66eba3c065c26d.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/af044c4723ff21634e66eba3c065c26d.mp4?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/9dd4febffd093d884a4e767f312c1fa9.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/9dd4febffd093d884a4e767f312c1fa9.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/9dd4febffd093d884a4e767f312c1fa9.mp4?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather treasure in ever-changing dungeons and conquer massive castles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make Bub's abilities and skills stronger using the treasure you collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger with Bub and explore even deeper into the dungeons and castles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Game features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The first in the series to feature &quot;&quot;dungeons&quot;&quot; that change every time you step into them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you enter a dungeon, the shape of the stage, the platforms, the enemies that appear, and their placement change, so you can always enjoy a fresh level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/540effad9f4368299cb6a172a67fccae.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/540effad9f4368299cb6a172a67fccae.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/540effad9f4368299cb6a172a67fccae.mp4?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't necessarily have to beat all of the enemies in this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply trap them or defeat them your way, and move on to the next stage by passing through the donut-shaped gate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/981b207826290e9774b7fdac99967df8.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/981b207826290e9774b7fdac99967df8.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/981b207826290e9774b7fdac99967df8.mp4?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dungeons, it is easy to get &quot;&quot;treasures&quot;&quot; that can be used to make Bub stronger, so dive back into dungeons repeatedly to collect treasures and build Bub's skills up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/108ab54d37ce3201be5742809bbd2fde.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/108ab54d37ce3201be5742809bbd2fde.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/108ab54d37ce3201be5742809bbd2fde.mp4?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you get used to the controls and familiar with leveling Bub up, we recommend challenging your limits and dive even deeper into the dungeon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/4dd132d998b52cd4cdfd36c15a68dad8.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/4dd132d998b52cd4cdfd36c15a68dad8.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/4dd132d998b52cd4cdfd36c15a68dad8.mp4?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/099a32de16ba76a97baa90ae6a37c7f1.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/099a32de16ba76a97baa90ae6a37c7f1.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/099a32de16ba76a97baa90ae6a37c7f1.mp4?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Uncover the map as you traverse massive castles. Another series first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castles are massive stages filled with a labyrinth of rooms. Will you get lost in the maze, or will you use your wits to make it through?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique bosses also await you inside, so give Bub the proper training and equipment to aim for the deepest part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/fa93bf63f2b709d6756da868d6195370.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/fa93bf63f2b709d6756da868d6195370.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Master new and returning skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Water Bubble is back in a new form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also find new skills that will help you along your journey, like Balloon Wig, which you can control mid-air, and Rolling Attack, which wipes enemies out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use skills to break through paths that were once inaccessible, and wipe out tough enemies all at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master them and sweep away your enemies in one fell swoop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/72d8035226415d66c4918d855f8726b6.poster.avif?t=1787712353\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/72d8035226415d66c4918d855f8726b6.webm?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937770/extras/72d8035226415d66c4918d855f8726b6.mp4?t=1787712353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find the skills and strategies that suit you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skills you have learned become items you can use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of items you can take to a dungeon at once is fixed, so it's up to you to decide what kind of skill items and useful items you take and how many of them you take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also up to you to decide in what order to strengthen Bub with the treasures you have collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find the skills and strategies that suit you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■The setting of the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting of the new Bubble Bobble game is a world full of &quot;&quot;strange&quot;&quot; sweet treats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Candy-shaped enemies start appearing in vibrant dungeons.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■The Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bub wakes up to find himself in a strange laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, the mysterious Dolcen suddenly appears and gives him a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mission to gather untouched treasure that lies inside dungeons and castles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bub loves a good adventure, so how could he resist this talk of treasure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With that, Bub's sweet and silly journey begins.</p>",
